WEBVTT

00:00:01.620 --> 00:00:05.370
Banda Terrace

00:00:06.580 --> 00:00:08.080
Shamiko...

00:00:09.120 --> 00:00:11.910
Shamiko, can you hear me?

00:00:18.750 --> 00:00:19.870
My ancestor?!

00:00:19.870 --> 00:00:20.700
That's right.

00:00:20.910 --> 00:00:23.910
I was able to reach out to your consciousness
with incredible ease this evening.

00:00:24.660 --> 00:00:28.950
For some reason, you've been simply overflowing
with magic since earlier today.

00:00:28.950 --> 00:00:30.830
We can't afford to let this opportunity go to waste!

00:00:30.830 --> 00:00:31.870
Which is why...

00:00:31.870 --> 00:00:41.950
SNEAK ATTACK!

00:00:31.870 --> 00:00:41.950
INTO THE NEIGHBOR'S DREAM

00:00:32.660 --> 00:00:37.330
...this is going to be a special episode where you
sneak into Momo's consciousness and control her!

00:00:37.330 --> 00:00:38.700
Whoop! Whoop! Honk! Honk!

00:00:38.700 --> 00:00:40.120
What the heck is that shoddy prop?!

00:00:40.120 --> 00:00:41.950
Whoop! Honk! Honk!

00:00:52.830 --> 00:00:55.500
The Demon Girl Next Door

00:00:55.500 --> 00:00:58.450
The sun is shining too brightly

00:00:58.540 --> 00:01:01.290
(I rubbed my eyes from the glare)

00:01:01.290 --> 00:01:04.250
I took off without even thinking

00:01:04.330 --> 00:01:06.790
(It's time for us to spark the joy)

00:01:06.790 --> 00:01:12.540
When I hold back my swaying bangs with my left hand

00:01:12.620 --> 00:01:17.120
These familiar sights start to shine

00:01:17.200 --> 00:01:18.330
(Three, two, one)

00:01:18.410 --> 00:01:23.370
We want to share our secret, right now

00:01:24.200 --> 00:01:29.870
Anything is possible for us

00:01:27.580 --> 00:01:29.870
(Always stay by my side)

00:01:29.950 --> 00:01:32.040
For sure

00:01:30.450 --> 00:01:32.540
(We trust each other)

00:01:32.540 --> 00:01:38.500
On that street corner we found a precious treasure

00:01:38.580 --> 00:01:44.330
Even if you went far away, I would definitely run after you

00:01:44.410 --> 00:01:50.410
Our future is here, forever burning bright

00:01:50.540 --> 00:01:55.620
The fun is only just getting started

00:02:11.910 --> 00:02:16.910
Courage to Face the Future!!
The Heavy Roller Won't Stop

00:02:16.910 --> 00:02:19.790
What exactly do you mean when you say
we're going to "control" Momo? It sounds bad.

00:02:19.790 --> 00:02:22.500
Don't worry, you won't have to do anything violent.

00:02:22.500 --> 00:02:27.080
You're simply going to use the power of our clan to dive
into Momo's subconsciousness while she's asleep.

00:02:27.080 --> 00:02:29.910
Then you'll plant an idea in her mind
that she'll act on immediately after she wakes up.

00:02:32.790 --> 00:02:37.330
When you wake up, give your blood to Queen Shamiko.
When you wake up, give your blood to Queen Shamiko.

00:02:37.620 --> 00:02:39.750
Top of the morning to you!

00:02:39.290 --> 00:02:43.250
Momo's Pure Blood

00:02:39.750 --> 00:02:40.540
Queen Shamiko!

00:02:40.540 --> 00:02:43.250
Sorry to keep you waiting, here's 10 gallons of my blood!

00:02:43.250 --> 00:02:45.250
Yes, most excellent!

00:02:47.290 --> 00:02:50.000
Momo would never say something
like that no matter how you try to trick her!

00:02:50.000 --> 00:02:51.910
Why do you seem more than a little upset about this?!

00:02:51.910 --> 00:02:56.620
HEH
HEH
HEH

00:02:51.910 --> 00:02:54.790
When people are asleep,
they put their guard down against the irrational.

00:02:53.160 --> 00:02:56.620
TRIPLE HEH

00:02:54.790 --> 00:02:56.620
Even Momo should be totally disoriented!

00:02:56.750 --> 00:02:58.000
I'm not so sure about that.

00:02:58.000 --> 00:03:00.910
We've gotta make the best of it
while your magic signal has full bars!

00:03:00.910 --> 00:03:02.660
You were even able to transform this afternoon!

00:03:02.660 --> 00:03:05.410
Transform...? Oh yeah, what the heck was up with that?

00:03:05.410 --> 00:03:06.700
Wasn't it just the coolest thing ever?

00:03:07.000 --> 00:03:09.450
No, it actually made things really awkward
with the neighbors!

00:03:09.450 --> 00:03:13.290
But in that form your physical abilities improve just a bit.

00:03:13.290 --> 00:03:15.500
It will come in really handy
whenever you have to flee the scene!

00:03:15.750 --> 00:03:18.120
All right, let's get you inside of Momo's subconscious.

00:03:18.120 --> 00:03:20.660
But isn't this basically just brainwashing?

00:03:20.660 --> 00:03:22.250
Are you not on board with that?

00:03:22.870 --> 00:03:26.040
If you ask me, this makes way more sense
than challenging her to a fist-fight.

00:03:27.120 --> 00:03:28.790
Besides, you're a total amateur.

00:03:28.790 --> 00:03:30.540
Whatever suggestion you plant in her
will wear off really fast.

00:03:30.540 --> 00:03:31.450
But...

00:03:32.080 --> 00:03:34.660
This method also assures that Momo
won't suffer any unnecessary wounds.

00:03:34.660 --> 00:03:37.540
And you'll be able to pay her back in no time
once the seal has been broken.

00:03:37.540 --> 00:03:40.250
Oh, that makes sense. I can totally avoid
any direct confrontation.

00:03:40.540 --> 00:03:42.080
And if I don't have to fight her for real,

00:03:41.160 --> 00:03:48.000
SNEAK ATTACK!
INTO
THE NEIGHBOR'S
DREAM

00:03:42.080 --> 00:03:46.410
then I won't get roped into any nonsensical running
and won't ever feel my whole body in pain again!

00:03:46.410 --> 00:03:47.580
Sorry I put you through so much trouble.

00:03:49.160 --> 00:03:52.500
That's a Dream Mirror that I made
by borrowing some of your magic.

00:03:52.500 --> 00:03:54.000
I thought it was just a big rice paddle.

00:03:54.000 --> 00:03:55.540
What the hell gave you that impression?

00:03:55.540 --> 00:03:59.040
SNEAK ATTACK!
INTO
THE NEIGHBOR'S
DREAM

00:03:55.540 --> 00:03:59.040
Focus your mind and stare into the mirror.
You can see something speeding by really fast, right?

00:03:57.200 --> 00:03:59.040
STARE

00:03:59.040 --> 00:04:00.950
It looks like... static TV noise.

00:04:00.950 --> 00:04:05.580
It's dreams of your family, school friends,
neighbors and dogs... anyone close to your channel.

00:04:05.870 --> 00:04:08.870
When you see Momo's dream line up perfectly,
perform a skill stop and smash the mirror to pieces!

00:04:08.330 --> 00:04:10.290
Let's warp!

00:04:08.450 --> 00:04:09.040
Warp

00:04:08.450 --> 00:04:09.040
Let's

00:04:08.870 --> 00:04:10.290
What is this, a fighting game?!

00:04:11.450 --> 00:04:14.750
More than a hundred different people are flying by
in only a few seconds. This is impossible!

00:04:14.750 --> 00:04:16.620
All I can make out are gray afterimages.

00:04:16.620 --> 00:04:19.370
Hm, it seems like your frequency
isn't attuned to Momo very well.

00:04:19.620 --> 00:04:22.290
Just build up all the dark feelings
you have towards Momo!

00:04:22.290 --> 00:04:24.620
If you do that then I'm sure you'll be able
to enter the Bonus Round!

00:04:24.620 --> 00:04:26.660
"Dark feelings"?! And what the heck is a "Bonus Round"?!

00:04:27.080 --> 00:04:28.660
Momo is... uh...

00:04:28.660 --> 00:04:34.580
Darkness... Darkness... Darkness... Darkness...

00:04:28.660 --> 00:04:32.250
...the person who saved me from the dump trunk
and also saved my octopus wieners.

00:04:29.040 --> 00:04:34.580
SNEAK ATTACK!
INTO THE NEIGHBOR'S DREAM
DARKNESS

00:04:29.040 --> 00:04:34.580
DARKNESS

00:04:32.250 --> 00:04:34.580
She also helped me find the thing that Ryo really wanted.

00:04:34.580 --> 00:04:36.080
Ancestor! This isn't good!

00:04:36.080 --> 00:04:38.250
I can't think of anything dark! I got nothing!

00:04:38.250 --> 00:04:39.870
Can we make this my homework
for the week or something?

00:04:39.870 --> 00:04:41.660
I promise I'll come up with something firm
by this weekend!

00:04:41.660 --> 00:04:43.040
No way! You have to get this done tonight!

00:04:43.290 --> 00:04:45.500
There has to be... something I don't like about Momo.

00:04:43.410 --> 00:04:45.450
SNEAK ATTACK!
INTO THE NEIGHBOR'S DREAM

00:04:45.700 --> 00:04:47.750
Do you want some too, Shamiko? It's really yummy.

00:04:45.870 --> 00:04:48.290
SNEAK ATTACK!
INTO THE NEIGHBOR'S DREAM

00:04:48.410 --> 00:04:51.450
Whenever you're around it really
throws my life out of whack! Darn it!

00:04:59.790 --> 00:05:03.250
MUCK

00:04:59.790 --> 00:05:03.250
MUCK

00:04:59.790 --> 00:05:02.290
Where the heck am I now?!
Everything's covered in muck, did I screw up?!

00:05:02.580 --> 00:05:03.250
Huh?

00:05:03.580 --> 00:05:04.790
Momo!

00:05:05.700 --> 00:05:07.000
Um...

00:05:07.000 --> 00:05:08.250
You look...

00:05:08.370 --> 00:05:10.120
Uh, you ARE Momo right?

00:05:10.120 --> 00:05:11.410
You're kind of tiny though.

00:05:11.410 --> 00:05:13.000
I am. Who are you, lady?

00:05:13.000 --> 00:05:13.660
Huh?

00:05:13.660 --> 00:05:17.370
Maybe Momo doesn't know who I am
because we're inside a dream right now?

00:05:17.370 --> 00:05:18.910
Plus, she's tiny and has longer hair.

00:05:19.870 --> 00:05:23.250
I was just passing by, I'm Shami...
I mean, I'm a Denizen of the Dark!

00:05:20.040 --> 00:05:26.120
SNEAK ATTACK!
INTO
THE NEIGHBOR'S
DREAM

00:05:23.250 --> 00:05:25.450
I came to get a first-hand look at your dream!

00:05:25.790 --> 00:05:26.370
Huh?

00:05:26.370 --> 00:05:29.040
So, uh... this is quite the dreamscape, huh?

00:05:29.040 --> 00:05:31.580
Seems like you might have slipped in some mud,
or maybe ate some liver...

00:05:32.620 --> 00:05:34.040
She's totally shutting me out!

00:05:34.040 --> 00:05:37.660
Actually, to be honest with you,
I came here hoping to undo a seal.

00:05:37.660 --> 00:05:40.040
I would really appreciate it if you could share
some of your Magical Girl blood with me.

00:05:40.040 --> 00:05:42.870
I can't do that. You're a Demon Lady, aren't you?

00:05:43.040 --> 00:05:46.120
Besides, I can't afford to just donate my blood.
That would weaken my magic powers.

00:05:46.080 --> 00:05:50.540
SNEAK ATTACK!
INTO THE NEIGHBOR'S DREAM

00:05:46.120 --> 00:05:49.250
And in order to keep this city peaceful,
my magic can't become any weaker than it is right now.

00:05:49.250 --> 00:05:50.250
"Peaceful"?

00:05:50.540 --> 00:05:53.000
MUCK

00:05:50.540 --> 00:05:53.000
MUCK

00:05:50.540 --> 00:05:53.000
But... I've done a really poor job of that already.

00:05:53.000 --> 00:05:54.660
MUCK

00:05:53.000 --> 00:05:54.660
MUCK

00:05:53.000 --> 00:05:54.660
Agh! The muck is starting to build up!

00:05:54.660 --> 00:05:57.450
Does it just get worse and worse
when baby Momo starts shedding tears?!

00:05:57.450 --> 00:05:59.370
These aren't tears, it's eye juice.

00:05:57.450 --> 00:05:59.370
MUCK

00:05:57.450 --> 00:05:59.370
MUCK

00:05:59.370 --> 00:06:01.500
It's fine, you don't have to force yourself
to lie to me right now!

00:05:59.580 --> 00:06:02.330
MUCK

00:05:59.580 --> 00:06:02.330
MUCK

00:06:01.500 --> 00:06:02.330
Stand up!

00:06:02.330 --> 00:06:10.370
MUCK

00:06:02.330 --> 00:06:10.370
MUCK

00:06:03.790 --> 00:06:07.370
At this rate we're both going to drown
before I can even plant any ideas in her head.

00:06:07.540 --> 00:06:09.950
What happens if we drown inside a dream?!

00:06:10.370 --> 00:06:12.580
Crisis Management!

00:06:36.500 --> 00:06:38.160
Momo! We're going to clean.

00:06:38.160 --> 00:06:40.370
This is a compulsory cleanup
of your entire mind, top to bottom.

00:06:40.540 --> 00:06:41.830
Please assist me.

00:06:42.620 --> 00:06:43.910
Why did you strip off your clothes?

00:06:43.910 --> 00:06:45.830
I didn't strip, this is my Crisis Management Form!

00:06:45.830 --> 00:06:47.250
No more talk, get to work.

00:06:49.200 --> 00:06:51.040
We managed to clear up the majority of it.

00:06:51.250 --> 00:06:54.540
It ended up pretty bleak in here, though.
It took more effort than I had expected.

00:06:55.040 --> 00:06:56.950
You're starting to look a bit better.

00:06:56.950 --> 00:06:58.040
Would you like some cola?

00:06:58.910 --> 00:07:01.200
It seems I can only produce things that I've seen recently.

00:07:01.200 --> 00:07:03.540
SNEAK ATTACK!
INTO
THE NEIGHBOR'S
DREAM

00:07:01.210 --> 00:07:03.250
But I'm starting to get the hang of my powers.

00:07:03.580 --> 00:07:07.000
Now then, with all of the muck out of the way
I can start planting ideas... Huh?

00:07:07.000 --> 00:07:09.950
SNEAK ATTACK!
INTO THE NEIGHBOR'S DREAM

00:07:08.080 --> 00:07:09.080
What?

00:07:09.950 --> 00:07:10.870
Momo?!

00:07:10.870 --> 00:07:13.450
I ran out of time?!

00:07:18.620 --> 00:07:20.250
I was so close...

00:07:23.750 --> 00:07:26.200
I remember everything that happened in the dream.

00:07:26.370 --> 00:07:28.910
But if Momo remembers everything too, then...

00:07:29.580 --> 00:07:32.910
I've got you now, Peeping Demon!
You deserve a good smackerel!

00:07:35.040 --> 00:07:35.790
Good morning.

00:07:35.790 --> 00:07:38.120
I'M SO VERY SORRY!

00:07:38.120 --> 00:07:40.450
P-please don't... not the smackerel!

00:07:38.200 --> 00:07:41.370
SHAKE
SHAKE

00:07:40.450 --> 00:07:41.450
What are you talking about?

00:07:41.450 --> 00:07:42.540
Oh, you don't remember...

00:07:43.080 --> 00:07:43.870
Huh?

00:07:44.540 --> 00:07:47.910
You look really pale in the face, Momo.
And your usually clean-cut hair is a mess, too!

00:07:47.910 --> 00:07:48.910
You think so?

00:07:48.910 --> 00:07:51.040
Actually, I feel like I may have caught a cold yesterday.

00:07:51.450 --> 00:07:52.410
Why do you have that?

00:07:52.410 --> 00:07:55.700
I don't really know myself, but for some reason
I've developed a strong urge to drink cola.

00:07:55.700 --> 00:07:57.290
Don't tell me, this is because...

00:07:57.290 --> 00:08:00.250
And also, I'm... not feeling so great.

00:08:00.250 --> 00:08:01.370
Momo?!

00:08:02.330 --> 00:08:04.410
Momo Chiyoda won't be able to come today.

00:08:04.450 --> 00:08:06.790
5 YEN
(5 cents)

00:08:04.790 --> 00:08:06.830
She started feeling really sick on her way to school.

00:08:07.160 --> 00:08:10.660
Yes. I'm going to make sure that she gets home okay,
so I'll be coming late.

00:08:10.660 --> 00:08:12.080
Thank you, please excuse me!

00:08:12.910 --> 00:08:14.250
Could the cause of this be...

00:08:14.250 --> 00:08:17.700
...some negative impact from all
the cleaning we did in her subconscious?

00:08:18.700 --> 00:08:20.370
Are you okay, Momo?

00:08:20.750 --> 00:08:22.540
I had a really weird dream last night.

00:08:23.120 --> 00:08:25.580
I don't remember much, but it wasn't pleasant.

00:08:25.580 --> 00:08:28.620
Although, I felt really relieved at the tail end of it...

00:08:29.410 --> 00:08:31.410
You felt really relieved?

00:08:31.410 --> 00:08:32.040
Yeah.

00:08:32.040 --> 00:08:34.290
I also vaguely remember it involved an exhibitionist.

00:08:34.290 --> 00:08:36.790
I'm not an exhibitionist, that was my Battle Form!

00:08:37.330 --> 00:08:40.410
Momo, can you help guide me to where your house is?

00:08:41.370 --> 00:08:42.700
She's already half-asleep!

00:08:42.700 --> 00:08:45.160
Wait, her guard is down so this might be...

00:08:46.200 --> 00:08:47.410
Shamiko...

00:08:48.040 --> 00:08:48.950
I'm sorry.

00:08:51.330 --> 00:08:53.410
I'll let you off the hook for today!

00:08:53.410 --> 00:08:54.370
You're heavy!

00:08:54.370 --> 00:08:59.790
Don't give up, Shamiko! Be proud of the fact
that you found a working payphone in this day and age!

00:09:13.250 --> 00:09:17.290
Wh-wha-what?!

00:09:17.450 --> 00:09:18.540
HUGE

00:09:18.540 --> 00:09:21.330
You live in a Community Center?!

00:09:21.330 --> 00:09:22.580
This is a house.

00:09:23.370 --> 00:09:27.080
Thanks, I can manage just fine on my own from here.

00:09:27.080 --> 00:09:28.000
My bag...

00:09:27.250 --> 00:09:30.000
Bag

00:09:28.000 --> 00:09:29.950
No way! You can hardly stay standing!

00:09:30.580 --> 00:09:32.580
I'm worried... no, that's not right.

00:09:32.580 --> 00:09:36.410
Since I'm already here, it's only proper etiquette
that I steal some of my rival's secrets!

00:09:39.870 --> 00:09:44.620
Let me guess, if I don't step on the right tiles here,
I'll be dropped into a tank of flour!

00:09:44.620 --> 00:09:46.040
Those little lamps are suspicious, too!

00:09:46.040 --> 00:09:48.620
It's just an ordinary walkway,
so you can step wherever you want.

00:09:48.620 --> 00:09:50.830
Then I'm going to take the path
where I only step on the white ones.

00:09:53.000 --> 00:09:54.910
The door has an auto-lock.

00:09:54.910 --> 00:09:56.620
It will open if you put in the security code.

00:09:56.620 --> 00:09:58.120
Why is your house so high-tech?!

00:09:58.290 --> 00:10:02.290
Let me guess, if I input the wrong code,
then I'll be dropped into a tank full of lobsters!

00:10:02.290 --> 00:10:03.950
They'll clamp their claws onto my nose!

00:10:03.950 --> 00:10:05.370
It's an ordinary number lock.

00:10:05.660 --> 00:10:08.080
The code is: "Live Chicks n' Jive Tricks Wahoo."

00:10:09.080 --> 00:10:11.080
Live Chicks 'n' Jive Tricks Wahoo

00:10:09.950 --> 00:10:11.080
What...?

00:10:11.080 --> 00:10:13.080
I made a mistake, it's "Five, Six, Five, Six, Two."

00:10:13.080 --> 00:10:15.290
"Live Chicks n' Jive Tricks Wahoo"! I've memorized it!

00:10:16.500 --> 00:10:18.450
Do you have a thermometer anywhere?

00:10:18.540 --> 00:10:22.040
I'm not sure. Maybe in the drawer of the computer desk.

00:10:23.450 --> 00:10:24.660
This is super cute!

00:10:25.040 --> 00:10:28.790
That's not a thermometer.
That's my Heartful Peach Morphing Stick.

00:10:28.790 --> 00:10:29.910
Heartful!

00:10:29.910 --> 00:10:31.120
I made a mistake.

00:10:31.290 --> 00:10:33.500
That's just an ordinary stick, so go put it back.

00:10:33.500 --> 00:10:35.330
You can go home now, I'll be all right.

00:10:35.500 --> 00:10:37.870
I'm getting excited, it's too early to leave yet!

00:10:37.870 --> 00:10:39.450
I get the feeling I can win the fight today!

00:10:40.410 --> 00:10:40.950
Huh?

00:10:40.950 --> 00:10:41.950
A kitty!

00:10:42.250 --> 00:10:44.620
That's my navigator, Metako.

00:10:44.620 --> 00:10:45.910
"Navigator"?

00:10:46.080 --> 00:10:49.580
A familiar of the Light Clan.
They provide guidance to Magical Girls.

00:10:50.660 --> 00:10:53.790
If you put it in a good mood with toys or something,
it will give you an oracle.

00:10:53.790 --> 00:10:55.910
It just spits out holy oracles like a dad telling jokes?!

00:10:56.200 --> 00:10:57.080
Gah!

00:10:57.080 --> 00:11:03.500
Gritty, gritty. Gritty, gritty...

00:10:57.080 --> 00:10:59.330
I feel something really gritty...

00:11:00.540 --> 00:11:03.500
Yeah, I thought it might get attached to your tail.

00:11:03.790 --> 00:11:07.950
It used to talk quite a lot, but because of its age
and the fact that I've lost my motivation

00:11:07.950 --> 00:11:11.580
now it's basically a regular cat 97% of the time.

00:11:11.830 --> 00:11:13.830
I'd really like to hear it talk.

00:11:13.830 --> 00:11:14.950
The time hath come.

00:11:16.120 --> 00:11:18.370
I-I think I just got an oracle.

00:11:18.370 --> 00:11:19.620
Even though I'm a Demon.

00:11:19.620 --> 00:11:22.040
It does that all the time to the mailman and the vet.

00:11:22.040 --> 00:11:24.830
Since it's past its prime, "The time hath come"
is all it really says now, anyway.

00:11:24.830 --> 00:11:26.200
Is that so?

00:11:27.330 --> 00:11:29.580
I've been talking too much. I'm going to rest for a bit.

00:11:29.580 --> 00:11:30.700
Ah, I'm sorry.

00:11:31.000 --> 00:11:32.620
You seem in worse shape than before.

00:11:32.620 --> 00:11:35.580
Do you really not know where you keep
the thermometer or medicine?

00:11:35.580 --> 00:11:37.700
I don't really get sick, usually.

00:11:38.120 --> 00:11:41.040
I feel like I last used the medicine box about...
10 years ago.

00:11:41.040 --> 00:11:43.160
Then I don't think you need to bother
trying to find it anymore!

00:11:43.160 --> 00:11:44.330
The time hath come.

00:11:44.330 --> 00:11:45.120
Exactly!

00:11:45.120 --> 00:11:47.000
Medicine has an expiration date!

00:11:47.000 --> 00:11:48.250
You two became fast friends.

00:11:48.250 --> 00:11:50.750
We at least have to find a way to cool your forehead.

00:11:50.750 --> 00:11:52.500
Can I open the fridge?

00:11:52.500 --> 00:11:53.160
Sure.

00:11:53.700 --> 00:11:56.790
Momo, can you tell me where exactly
I can find the ice in here?

00:11:57.290 --> 00:11:58.080
Huh?

00:11:59.700 --> 00:12:00.620
What is this?

00:12:00.580 --> 00:12:01.000
SHOCK!!

00:12:00.620 --> 00:12:02.250
Ah, I changed my mind about the fridge!

00:12:02.250 --> 00:12:04.000
Don't open the fridge, Shamiko!

00:12:05.660 --> 00:12:06.790
Momo!

00:12:07.620 --> 00:12:09.250
What's gotten into you all of a sudden?

00:12:09.250 --> 00:12:10.250
You already found it, huh?

00:12:10.250 --> 00:12:12.500
You... didn't want me to see this?

00:12:11.080 --> 00:12:15.000
MUCK...

00:12:12.750 --> 00:12:15.040
Don't tell me this is a monument you made
from pulverizing Demons?

00:12:15.040 --> 00:12:16.000
Absolutely not!

00:12:16.000 --> 00:12:19.080
That's... my failed attempt at making hamburg steak.

00:12:19.750 --> 00:12:21.950
Something this dark and sinister...

00:12:19.910 --> 00:12:26.750
Something this
dark and sinister...

00:12:21.950 --> 00:12:25.290
...can only be made from the deep-seated hatred
of a Demon that faced punishment beyond imagination.

00:12:25.290 --> 00:12:26.700
It's made from plain old beef!

00:12:26.910 --> 00:12:28.450
Why were you making a hamburg steak?

00:12:28.450 --> 00:12:30.330
Because I made that promise to you, Shamiko.

00:12:30.330 --> 00:12:32.620
Huh? Oh, you mean when we practiced shooting magic.

00:12:32.620 --> 00:12:36.580
Yeah. I just kind of blurted it out back then,
but I planned on keeping that promise.

00:12:36.750 --> 00:12:39.290
But I only have experience cooking pre-made food...

00:12:39.290 --> 00:12:41.200
... and no matter what I did I couldn't make
a tasty hamburg steak.

00:12:41.790 --> 00:12:44.290
It would be a waste to throw away,
so I've been eating it myself.

00:12:44.290 --> 00:12:46.910
But my heart could never take
more than just one bite per meal...

00:12:46.910 --> 00:12:48.700
I'm guessing that's what caused you to get sick.

00:12:49.040 --> 00:12:50.870
If you made it for me, then I'm going to eat it!

00:12:52.500 --> 00:12:53.410
Gulp.

00:12:52.790 --> 00:12:53.500
Gulp

00:12:53.410 --> 00:12:56.290
I was really nervous going by looks alone,
but this doesn't taste bad at all!

00:12:56.290 --> 00:12:57.000
Y-you think so?

00:12:57.000 --> 00:13:01.580
It's hard on the outside and mushy on the inside,
plus I can really taste the raw onions and salt.

00:13:01.580 --> 00:13:03.410
I'm not so sure that's a good thing.

00:13:03.410 --> 00:13:04.700
It's just fine!

00:13:04.700 --> 00:13:07.830
Truly terrible food makes you go numb
the moment you bite into it,

00:13:07.830 --> 00:13:10.040
and your throat will force you
to throw it back up right away!

00:13:10.040 --> 00:13:12.450
Anything that doesn't cause that reaction is totally edible!

00:13:12.450 --> 00:13:13.870
Do you have any clean chopsticks?

00:13:12.620 --> 00:13:14.330
Do you have
any clean
chopsticks?

00:13:14.330 --> 00:13:24.370
Warning:
This girl has undergone
special training in this field
as part of her family's
circumstances.
Please be very careful
to confirm whether
food prepared and
left out during the summer
is safe to eat.

00:13:14.500 --> 00:13:18.370
Warning: This girl has undergone special training
in this field as part of her family's circumstances.

00:13:18.370 --> 00:13:21.500
Please be very careful to confirm whether food prepared
and left out during the summer is safe to eat.

00:13:21.870 --> 00:13:24.080
You have a large strike zone when it comes to food, huh?

00:13:24.790 --> 00:13:26.330
Thanks for the meal!

00:13:26.330 --> 00:13:28.500
I'm embarrassed that you ended up seeing my screw up.

00:13:28.620 --> 00:13:31.700
If you always live in fear of other people
seeing your weaknesses,

00:13:31.700 --> 00:13:34.040
then you'll never be able to make any progress in life.

00:13:34.040 --> 00:13:38.250
I've screwed up quite a lot myself, but despite that,
I've made progress a little bit at a time.

00:13:38.500 --> 00:13:39.660
I see.

00:13:40.500 --> 00:13:42.160
You're really strong, Shamiko.

00:13:42.160 --> 00:13:44.750
I guess I'll try cooking it again
and have you taste test it for me.

00:13:44.750 --> 00:13:45.620
Please do!

00:13:45.620 --> 00:13:49.580
I think you should reduce the amount of salt enough
so that the flavor of the meat actually comes through.

00:13:49.200 --> 00:13:53.830
HERE

00:13:49.580 --> 00:13:53.410
You went out of your way to use good beef, but all
I could taste was the flavor of salt, onion and charcoal?

00:13:54.330 --> 00:13:56.950
I changed my mind. You don't get any
until I've at least made it taste like a proper steak.

00:13:56.950 --> 00:13:58.040
Why?!

00:13:58.040 --> 00:14:01.750
All you had in your fridge aside from
the hamburg steak was wieners and plain bread.

00:14:01.750 --> 00:14:05.080
A diet like that isn't healthy,
even if you do live by yourself.

00:14:06.080 --> 00:14:08.950
I have an idea! Why don't you come over
to my house to eat sometime?

00:14:08.950 --> 00:14:11.950
My mom's specialty is hamburg steak,
so she might be able to teach you how to make it!

00:14:13.000 --> 00:14:15.250
I'd love to... come over and do that sometime.

00:14:15.250 --> 00:14:19.080
In our house, the main ingredient in hamburg steak
is tofu, so it's really fluffy and yummy!

00:14:19.080 --> 00:14:21.120
It also has some chicken breast meat and onions inside!

00:14:21.120 --> 00:14:23.000
Plus, it's covered in a thick sauce
with lots of mushrooms!

00:14:23.000 --> 00:14:24.330
Can that really be called "hamburg steak"?

00:14:24.330 --> 00:14:27.370
Anyway, I'm going to prepare a wet towel
to cool you off so please go and rest.

00:14:27.370 --> 00:14:31.160
I need you to recover and get back to being
a proper Magical Girl, otherwise I can't beat you!

00:14:31.160 --> 00:14:32.410
R-right...

00:14:34.660 --> 00:14:35.750
Zzz...

00:14:34.790 --> 00:14:39.410
Zzz... Zzz...

00:14:36.040 --> 00:14:37.200
Zzz...

00:14:36.370 --> 00:14:39.410
She's still got a fever,
but I think her breathing has returned to normal.

00:14:43.370 --> 00:14:45.950
Looking at her sleep like this,
she doesn't seem very strong at all.

00:14:45.950 --> 00:14:48.080
Crap, I don't have time for this!

00:14:48.080 --> 00:14:49.910
Don't think this means you've won!

00:14:49.910 --> 00:14:51.700
That's not nearly as satisfying to say in a whisper!

00:14:51.830 --> 00:14:54.700
Oh hey, we might have a stock of udon
or other soups at home.

00:14:55.120 --> 00:14:56.370
She's got a cut!

00:14:56.500 --> 00:14:58.080
Did that happen when she fell down earlier?

00:14:58.330 --> 00:15:00.290
Wipe
Wipe

00:14:58.450 --> 00:15:01.500
Jeez, Momo is really throwing everything
out of whack for me today!

00:15:04.620 --> 00:15:06.080
The time hath come.

00:15:09.250 --> 00:15:11.450
What's wrong, Metako?

00:15:16.790 --> 00:15:19.250
to get some food supplies
I'll be back soon.
-Yuko

00:15:16.790 --> 00:15:19.250
I'm going home

00:15:17.330 --> 00:15:18.830
My blood...

00:15:19.120 --> 00:15:23.330
Notice it, Shamiko! You've gotten your hands
on various precious things right now!

00:15:23.330 --> 00:15:25.700
I wonder if we have an ice pack in the fridge...

00:15:26.290 --> 00:15:27.540
I'm home!

00:15:27.540 --> 00:15:30.000
Though nobody else should be here right now, anyway.

00:15:30.000 --> 00:15:33.750
I'll make some udon for Momo
and then head for school in the afternoon.

00:15:35.330 --> 00:15:38.120
I'm feeling an aura of loneliness and pity
coming from somewhere!

00:15:38.120 --> 00:15:40.250
Oh crap! The Ancestue!

00:15:40.250 --> 00:15:43.080
It's being used as the perfect paper weight
for all the ads and junk mail we're throwing away!

00:15:43.330 --> 00:15:46.410
We've just gotten too used to it
being a decoration kept near the front door...

00:15:46.410 --> 00:15:48.790
I'm sorry, I'll take you to school later.

00:15:48.790 --> 00:15:50.750
I knew I felt more lightweight than usual today.

00:15:52.790 --> 00:15:54.410
I hope we have some udon handy.

00:15:55.250 --> 00:15:56.080
Huh?

00:15:59.250 --> 00:16:00.250
I'm too late...

00:16:00.250 --> 00:16:00.750
Huh?

00:16:01.790 --> 00:16:03.700
Momo? Why are you here?

00:16:03.700 --> 00:16:07.580
I was finally able to figure out where you live, Shamiko.
As I suspected, there was a barrier keeping it concealed.

00:16:07.580 --> 00:16:11.660
When you were taking care of me earlier,
you invited me over. Remember?

00:16:11.660 --> 00:16:15.790
I think in order for me to get past the barrier,
it was necessary to have your permission.

00:16:16.080 --> 00:16:18.000
Do you know what this is, Shamiko?

00:16:18.000 --> 00:16:18.620
Huh?

00:16:22.830 --> 00:16:24.200
A designer's door?

00:16:24.200 --> 00:16:26.120
You just thought it was a chic decoration, huh?

00:16:26.580 --> 00:16:28.410
This is a protection barrier of the Light Clan,

00:16:28.410 --> 00:16:32.330
it makes it fate that ordinary people
can't interact with those who live inside.

00:16:32.330 --> 00:16:37.500
It has deteriorated, but in order to get through a person
needs approval or be approached by the residents.

00:16:37.830 --> 00:16:40.200
It's a pretty complex barrier
that requires an advanced level of...

00:16:40.410 --> 00:16:45.040
YOSHIDA

00:16:41.000 --> 00:16:42.040
What are you doing?

00:16:42.040 --> 00:16:45.080
You're still burning up.
I think your fever has gotten worse!

00:16:45.080 --> 00:16:46.790
Now isn't the time to be worried about that.

00:16:46.790 --> 00:16:49.200
No! If we're going to talk, at least sit down first.

00:16:50.750 --> 00:16:52.290
Do you feel hungry at all?

00:16:52.290 --> 00:16:54.120
I do, but now really isn't the time to...

00:16:54.120 --> 00:16:57.160
Which do you prefer, a bowl of cold udon or hot udon?

00:16:57.160 --> 00:16:58.080
Cold.

00:17:02.910 --> 00:17:03.790
It's delicious.

00:17:03.790 --> 00:17:07.450
I just boiled some frozen udon and then added it
to a cold noodle stock with some fresh ginger.

00:17:07.580 --> 00:17:09.120
What's a "noodle stock"?

00:17:09.120 --> 00:17:12.450
Huh? A broth made from soy sauce,
kelp water, and sugar. You can buy it à la carte.

00:17:12.540 --> 00:17:15.410
Festival

00:17:12.790 --> 00:17:13.790
"A large cart"?

00:17:13.790 --> 00:17:15.370
Does everything trip you up when it comes to cooking?!

00:17:15.830 --> 00:17:16.790
I guess so.

00:17:16.790 --> 00:17:19.330
But you were frying up those wieners
the other day with such ease.

00:17:19.330 --> 00:17:20.580
Cooking is the one thing you can do, Shamiko.

00:17:20.580 --> 00:17:21.870
What do you mean "the one thing"?!

00:17:21.870 --> 00:17:25.500
This reminds me, we had udon the first time
we had a meal together.

00:17:25.750 --> 00:17:27.250
Anyway, back to business.

00:17:28.660 --> 00:17:30.290
You undid the seal earlier, right?

00:17:30.540 --> 00:17:31.540
Huh?

00:17:34.620 --> 00:17:37.200
You took my blood when I was asleep, didn't you?

00:17:34.620 --> 00:17:37.200
WHAT?

00:17:40.500 --> 00:17:41.660
You just realized it now?

00:17:41.830 --> 00:17:44.870
So, you undid the seal completely on accident then?

00:17:44.870 --> 00:17:46.620
I had forgotten all about it, to be honest.

00:17:46.620 --> 00:17:49.540
I mean, you were sick and injured...

00:17:49.540 --> 00:17:50.830
Well, whatever.

00:17:50.830 --> 00:17:52.330
I can't do anything about it now.

00:17:52.330 --> 00:17:54.790
Do you at least know what kind of seal you undid?

00:17:54.790 --> 00:17:59.330
From what I've heard, your family has a long history
of having the majority of your powers sealed away.

00:17:59.330 --> 00:17:59.950
Shock!

00:17:59.950 --> 00:18:03.950
I don't think any serious powers will come back
with just that tiny bit of blood, but...

00:18:03.950 --> 00:18:06.540
Why do you know about my family's history?

00:18:06.660 --> 00:18:08.290
Anri told me all about it.

00:18:08.450 --> 00:18:12.120
Oh, Shamiko? Up until this spring she was always
really sick and had to go home or to the hospital

00:18:09.330 --> 00:18:14.790
Oh, Shamiko? Up until this spring
she was always really sick and
had to go home or to the hospital

00:18:09.330 --> 00:18:14.790
but after she grew
those horns on her head,

00:18:09.330 --> 00:18:14.790
she's gotten a lot
healthier!

00:18:12.120 --> 00:18:14.700
but after she grew those horns on her head,
she's gotten a lot healthier!

00:18:14.700 --> 00:18:17.910
By the way, her family situation is complicated
and I guess they have to deal with a seal or something,

00:18:14.790 --> 00:18:19.620
By the way, her family situation
is complicated and I guess they
have to deal with a seal or something,

00:18:14.790 --> 00:18:19.620
I don't really know
all the deatils,on $400 a month.

00:18:14.790 --> 00:18:19.620
all the deatils,
but I hear they
can only live

00:18:17.910 --> 00:18:21.000
I don't really know all the details,
but I hear they can only live on $400 a month.

00:18:19.620 --> 00:18:22.830
Isn't that nuts?! Oh, and she doesn't go
to any after school clubs, either...

00:18:21.000 --> 00:18:23.700
Isn't that nuts?! Oh and she doesn't
go to any after school clubs, either....

00:18:23.700 --> 00:18:25.660
I just knew she was an assassin!

00:18:25.660 --> 00:18:29.330
Anyway, we should figure out
what kind of powers you got back.

00:18:29.330 --> 00:18:30.750
That sounds like a good idea to me.

00:18:31.040 --> 00:18:32.450
Did you hear that just now?

00:18:32.910 --> 00:18:33.830
I did.

00:18:35.620 --> 00:18:37.790
You've done it, Shadow Mistress!

00:18:37.790 --> 00:18:41.790
I've tasted the sweet, condensed flavor
of the Magical Girl's blood mixed with that musky towel.

00:18:41.790 --> 00:18:42.910
It's all thanks to you!

00:18:42.910 --> 00:18:43.660
Ancestor?!

00:18:44.120 --> 00:18:45.200
Now it begins...

00:18:45.620 --> 00:18:49.950
But I'll get sick with the world upside down like this,
so could you turn me right side up?

00:18:49.950 --> 00:18:51.200
Ah, I'm so sorry!

00:18:53.160 --> 00:18:55.410
What's going on, Ancestor?

00:18:55.410 --> 00:18:58.290
Apparently, I can now talk with you directly
in the real world.

00:18:58.290 --> 00:19:00.160
Mmmmph

00:18:58.290 --> 00:18:59.620
Mmmph!

00:18:58.290 --> 00:19:00.870
I've been trying really hard for a while now,

00:19:00.870 --> 00:19:02.290
but I can't produce anything but a mouth.

00:19:02.410 --> 00:19:04.450
I'd really love some arms and legs, too...

00:19:04.870 --> 00:19:06.080
Is that you, Ms. Lilith?

00:19:06.080 --> 00:19:07.540
Momo Chiyoda!

00:19:07.540 --> 00:19:10.120
I owe you a lot for that trip to the Health Spa!

00:19:10.450 --> 00:19:12.620
The only thing that changed
is the statue becoming more annoying?

00:19:12.620 --> 00:19:15.290
I had a chunk of my magic drained away just for that?

00:19:15.290 --> 00:19:16.290
What do you mean "just for that"?!

00:19:15.450 --> 00:19:19.450
Ugh...

00:19:16.290 --> 00:19:17.950
You're being incredibly rude right now!

00:19:17.950 --> 00:19:19.250
Ugh...

00:19:18.330 --> 00:19:19.450
Ugh...

00:19:19.870 --> 00:19:22.330
As a result, I've lost a significant amount of magic power.

00:19:22.700 --> 00:19:26.700
Shamiko, in exchange for the blood and magic
you borrowed from me

00:19:26.700 --> 00:19:28.330
I want you to help me protect the city.

00:19:28.330 --> 00:19:30.580
Huh?! Momo, you've been protecting the city?

00:19:30.580 --> 00:19:31.500
Yeah.

00:19:31.500 --> 00:19:34.700
Isn't it weird for a Demon
to help you with something like that?

00:19:34.700 --> 00:19:37.450
It's no less weird than a Demon
going out to the mall for some udon.

00:19:37.450 --> 00:19:38.330
Grr...

00:19:38.330 --> 00:19:45.330
But I didn't borrow your magic, I challenged you
and then won it fair and square... I think...

00:19:45.830 --> 00:19:49.620
Attacking someone you owe a bunch of debt to
while they're sick and asleep is unfair, right?

00:19:50.330 --> 00:19:51.330
That's cheating, right?

00:19:51.330 --> 00:19:53.250
Are you a cheat, Shamiko?

00:19:53.250 --> 00:19:56.330
But I... didn't do it on purpose,
I was trying to tend to your wound.

00:19:56.330 --> 00:19:58.540
Whether it was intentional or not,
I lost magic in the process.

00:19:58.870 --> 00:20:00.870
Whose uniform are you wearing, again?

00:20:01.000 --> 00:20:02.200
Not to mention that laptop.

00:20:03.160 --> 00:20:05.450
Until my magic recovers, you're going to help me. Right?

00:20:04.120 --> 00:20:05.540
Smile

00:20:05.450 --> 00:20:06.580
Th-this is unfair!

00:20:06.580 --> 00:20:10.330
Protecting the city would also benefit you, Shamiko.

00:20:10.330 --> 00:20:11.040
Huh?

00:20:11.040 --> 00:20:14.250
The peace of this city was only held together
by a delicate balance in the first place.

00:20:14.660 --> 00:20:18.450
Even losing just a single drop of blood results
in a drastic drop in magic power.

00:20:18.700 --> 00:20:22.580
My unstable condition should be delectable
even by those who live outside the city.

00:20:22.910 --> 00:20:26.200
If they pick up on it, some really weird people
might start coming around here.

00:20:26.450 --> 00:20:29.790
In the worst-case scenario, you, your family, and
all the Demons that live here might end up being hunted.

00:20:29.790 --> 00:20:32.290
I want you to protect them and yourself.

00:20:32.290 --> 00:20:34.450
My family?! That's absolutely unacceptable!

00:20:34.660 --> 00:20:36.620
I'll train hard! And do whatever you want me to!

00:20:36.910 --> 00:20:39.790
HEAVY ROLLER

00:20:37.040 --> 00:20:39.870
I'll swing a metal bat! Or pull a giant tire or something!

00:20:39.870 --> 00:20:41.450
Your idea of training is a tad outdated.

00:20:41.830 --> 00:20:45.700
Right now, the majority of Demons
and Magical Girls are peaceful types.

00:20:45.700 --> 00:20:47.660
Any sort of incident between them is rare.

00:20:47.950 --> 00:20:51.450
But no matter what... I want to keep this one city safe.

00:20:51.620 --> 00:20:52.660
Why is that?

00:20:52.660 --> 00:20:54.330
Don't get hung up on stuff like that.

00:20:54.330 --> 00:20:57.540
By the way, Momo... are you feeling under the weather?

00:20:57.540 --> 00:21:01.120
Are you going to be all right taking a hit
to your magic on top of being sick?

00:21:05.830 --> 00:21:07.370
To be perfectly honest...

00:21:07.370 --> 00:21:08.750
I'm the opposite of okay.

00:21:08.750 --> 00:21:11.830
MOMO!

00:21:11.830 --> 00:21:13.120
You've gone completely blue in the face!

00:21:13.120 --> 00:21:16.700
And your body temp feels hotter than the most intense
hot spring they had at the Health Spa!

00:21:23.700 --> 00:21:26.250
The time hath come. The time hath come.

00:21:26.450 --> 00:21:28.870
The time hath come. The time hath come.

00:21:29.250 --> 00:21:30.120
The time hath come.

00:21:30.540 --> 00:21:31.450
The time hath come.

00:21:31.450 --> 00:21:35.290
The time hath come... The time hath come...

00:21:31.450 --> 00:21:33.410
Don't think this means you've won.

00:21:33.410 --> 00:21:35.290
Huh? Did you say something just now?

00:21:38.000 --> 00:21:42.330
For about a week after this,
Momo stayed home from school.

00:21:44.120 --> 00:21:48.450
Say, Ancestor? Are a lot of things
going to start changing around me now?

00:21:48.620 --> 00:21:50.040
What should I do?

00:21:50.250 --> 00:21:53.200
You should handle things at your own pace,
as you see fit, Shamiko.

00:21:53.580 --> 00:21:56.500
You already made a huge accomplishment
by enabling me to talk once again.

00:21:56.500 --> 00:21:57.500
I give you my thanks.

00:21:57.500 --> 00:21:58.370
Great!

00:22:02.700 --> 00:22:05.080
I'll put some real thought into what I can do.

00:22:05.080 --> 00:22:08.790
For now, I need to report to my mom and Ryo
about the progress I made with the seal.

00:22:09.330 --> 00:22:13.000
By the way, is my nickname confirmed to be "Shamiko"?

00:22:13.000 --> 00:22:14.910
I think it's pretty fitting, don't you?

00:22:15.080 --> 00:22:20.000
Don't give up, Shamiko! Work on gaining a lot of
experience and become the most capable Demon!

00:22:22.410 --> 00:22:33.950
The Demon Girl Next Door

00:22:39.790 --> 00:22:41.160
Gallantly, I demand a duel

00:22:41.160 --> 00:22:42.700
I go at it, but I lose

00:22:42.700 --> 00:22:43.910
It's beyond disappointing

00:22:43.910 --> 00:22:45.450
Shift away from that grief

00:22:45.540 --> 00:22:46.870
Even when I’m feeling curt

00:22:46.870 --> 00:22:48.540
I’ll express myself with that tail

00:22:51.120 --> 00:22:52.330
There's a party in the neighborhood

00:22:52.410 --> 00:22:53.910
Even the dogs are going bow-wow

00:22:53.910 --> 00:22:55.200
Each and every last one

00:22:55.200 --> 00:22:56.660
For all four seasons

00:22:56.660 --> 00:22:59.950
When you fail just laugh it off

00:23:00.120 --> 00:23:06.450
Connecting our hearts like that time once before

00:23:06.870 --> 00:23:12.290
With the miracle that we met in this town

00:23:17.950 --> 00:23:19.040
Grant this wish

00:23:19.040 --> 00:23:21.830
Shoulder those tires and go full throttle

00:23:21.830 --> 00:23:24.620
Warning, there's still crises to manage, so enjoy

00:23:24.620 --> 00:23:30.160
Various blooming colors are spilling off the canvas

00:23:30.160 --> 00:23:33.040
Now its sunset, don't bother thinking too much

00:23:33.040 --> 00:23:35.290
Just go on!

00:23:35.450 --> 00:23:40.040
Come on, our compiled dreams can be any color

00:23:40.160 --> 00:23:41.830
So let's play some more

00:23:50.910 --> 00:24:05.950
Preview

00:23:51.370 --> 00:23:54.120
I was causing major plot developments
without even realizing it!

00:23:54.120 --> 00:23:55.910
Yeah, a ton of things happened in this episode.

00:23:55.910 --> 00:23:58.410
Thanks to Shamiko, I'm finally able to talk again!

00:23:58.410 --> 00:24:00.410
Ancestor, please keep your voice down!
Now that the Magical Girl's blood has partially undone the seal,

00:24:00.410 --> 00:24:02.080
And Momo, I really hope you get over that cold quickly!
I know the audience is looking forward to enjoying
all of my wonderful commentary

00:24:02.080 --> 00:24:05.950
The Pink Method!! The Wheel of Fate is a Round Tire!!

00:24:02.080 --> 00:24:04.330
Next time, Shamiko is going to work an all new job!
as I, the great Lilith, participate even more in the show!

00:24:04.330 --> 00:24:05.950
By the way, I called in some help.

00:24:04.870 --> 00:24:05.950
Also, I want better offerings fro-
